> 1 +
  1 +
     ^ unexpected end of input
> 2 * (3 + 4
  2 * (3 + 4
            ^ expected ')' but found end of input
> 3 $ 4
  3 $ 4
    ^ unexpected character '$'
> 10 / (5 - 5)
  10 / (5 - 5)
     ^ division by zero
> nope + 1
  nope + 1
  ^ unknown name 'nope'
> min()
  min()
  ^ min takes at least 1 argument(s), got 0
> sqrt(-1)
  sqrt(-1)
  ^ sqrt of a negative number
